      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure a smooth journey for your group, I've created a checklist of travel documents to review for each destination. \n\n* For Singapore, a visa is usually not required for Vietnamese and Thai citizens stays under 90 days. \n* For Malaysia, ensure all travelers meet the 'abolished visas requirements' if transiting and applying for entry at a different airport. Research if there are any 'Temporary Arrival Visa Exemptions' in case temporary stays exceed 90 days. \n* For Thailand, ensure your repeat existing or confirmed embassy-approved visa or check if a 'Registration Certificate VISA EXEMPT' is accepted during transit at Suvarnabhumi Airport.",
