      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one thing though—the team is a bit nervous about the stops in singapore and malaysia specifically. if they're just staying in the airport for a few hours between flights, do they still need to clear customs and show an entry visa, or can they just stay in the transit area? i dont want them to get stuck in some bottleneck at the gate if the rules are unclear.",
