      "content": "For Singapore and Malaysia, if your team is only transiting and not allowed to enter the country, they can remain in the transit area without clearance. \n\nIn Singapore, travelers on a 'visa-exempt' transit visa (e.g., the 'Transit in Singapore' ETA) and meet specific requirements can enter the transit area without going through customs. The team needs to ensure they have their 'Visa on Arrival' application submitted online before arrival.\n\nIn Malaysia, travelers meeting the 'visa-exempt' requirements for as low as 24 hours may stay in the transit area. Ensure that all team members carry 'Return/Onward tickets' as proof of transit.",
